        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Today you return to Hokkaido to eliminate this one target named Akira Nakamura. He is currently in a rest spa next to Hokkaido Hospital. He is dressed as a doctor, but is actually a high-level intelligence agent. We don&apos;t know much about him, and neither does our client. Our client, who owns this place, doesn&apos;t like Akira, and wants us to eliminate him, because it&apos;s certain that no one really knows who he is. Akira Nakamura is just a name tag on his clothes. Good luck.",
